= FAQ

#metadata(none) <sec-FAQ>

*My testing mode doesn't work*#linebreak()#v(-1.8pt) To enable testing mode, make sure that you have enabled testing mode on the flight computer through the Configurator and set a valid testing phrase. Otherwise, the flight computer will start in its default mode and will not accept testing commands from the Ground Station.#linebreak()#linebreak()#v(1.8pt)

*The Configurator sometimes doesn't apply my settings*#linebreak()#v(-1.8pt) Connect the flight computer directly to your computer without a USB hub. If that does not help, contact us on Discord or submit an issue on GitHub.#linebreak()#linebreak()#v(1.8pt)

*To be extended with user feedback...*#linebreak()#linebreak()#v(1.8pt)
